leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">需求激增 625 倍：戴尔CEO预警全球AI内存短缺将持续至 2028 年</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/33d58034ca83cc845e6333beb333a66a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">需求激增 625 倍：戴尔CEO预警全球AI内存短缺将持续至 2028 年AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Apr 9, 202612戴尔科技集团首席执行官迈克尔·戴尔近日发出严厉预警，指出全球AI加速器领域的内存需求正迎来爆发式增长。据预测，到 2028 年，这一需求量将比 2023 年增长整整 625 倍。这种近乎“跃迁式”的需求膨胀，正让全球半导体供应链面临前所未有的压力，供需失衡的僵局在短期内恐难打破。容量与规模双重爆发 这一惊人增幅主要由单机容量和部署规模共同推动。随着AI技术的快速演进，单颗AI加速器的内存配置将从 2023 年的80GB飞跃至 2028 年的2TB，增长达 25 倍。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">小米开源多语言TTS模型OmniVoice：支持600+语种，中文WER仅0.84%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2641898065be4413cddbc91d7bae1257.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">小米下一代Kaldi团队（k2-fsa）正式开源OmniVoice，这是一款支持超过600种语言的超大规模多语言零样本文本转语音（TTS）模型。该模型采用扩散语言模型风格的离散非自回归架构，可直接从文本生成语音。性能方面，OmniVoice在Seed-TTS中文测试集上的词错误率（WER）低至0.84%，多项指标超越ElevenLabs v2和MiniMax等主流商用模型。其推理实时因子（RTF）低至0.025，合成速度比实时快40倍。OmniVoice支持3-10秒短参考音频进行零样本语音克隆，并允许通过自然语言描述自定义性别、年龄、口音等属性，同时支持处理笑声等非语言符号及精细发音控制。该模型已在GitHub和Hugging Face开源，极大降低了开发者在多语言及低资源语言语音合成领域的部署门槛。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta发布Muse Spark个人超级智能模型，实现10倍算力优化与多Agent协同</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d0fa4295a7fc9ee150380d25457f759f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">4月9日，Meta正式发布Muse系列首款个人超级智能模型Muse Spark，现已上线Meta.ai官网及移动应用。该模型采用原生多模态架构，支持深度推理、工具调用及视觉思维链。核心亮点包括：Contemplating模式采用多Agent并行推理，在Humanity&#x27;s Last Exam基准测试中取得58%成绩；计算效率实现突破，同等性能下算力需求仅为Llama4Maverick的1/10。在视觉能力上，模型支持拍照生成数独等复杂任务；在健康领域，通过与1000多名医生联合训练，可对饮食照片进行营养分析并提供红绿点标注建议。目前，Meta已同步启动Muse Spark私有API预览，后续将持续迭代以强化个人超级智能定位。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Google将Gemini集成至Gmail并承诺不使用用户个人邮件训练AI模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/de3d6686540e8b9fe3710c1866de8eea.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Google近日宣布将生成式AI模型Gemini深度整合至Gmail，旨在提升邮件处理效率。为解决数据安全顾虑，Google明确承诺不会利用用户的个人邮件内容训练其底层AI模型。在技术实现上，Google打造了“私人房间”模式，Gemini仅在执行邮件润色、措辞校对、优先级排序及自动摘要等任务时拥有临时访问权，任务结束后即刻退出并失去权限，确保数据在隔离环境中处理。此举通过严格的数据隔离机制，试图在推动AI功能普及的同时，为全球数亿Gmail用户构建数字信任防线。目前，该集成功能已支持多项辅助办公任务，Google正通过严苛的隐私标准强化其在办公软件市场的竞争优势，以应对当前行业内频繁出现的数据安全争议。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic完成员工股权要约收购，因员工惜售导致实际成交规模低于预期</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d8495333cc73fd708a9f4b2acf78a186.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic已完成今年初启动的存量股份转让，但受员工惜售心态影响，最终成交规模远低于此前预期的60亿美元。此次要约收购定价与2月份最新一轮融资估值保持一致，进一步锁定了Anthropic 3500亿美元的估值水平。尽管投资者准备了巨额现金，但因员工倾向于持有股份以等待预计最早于今年启动的IPO，导致市场出现供不应求局面。作为OpenAI的主要竞争对手，Anthropic此次股权转让表现出核心团队对公司技术路径及上市溢价的极高信心。在当前全球科技股波动背景下，顶级AI大模型企业的股权仍是资本市场竞相追逐的稀缺资源。此次事件不仅是Anthropic的股权结构调整，更被视为其向全球投资者展示公司前景与上市准备的信号。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
